<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-Bank Papan first-half net down.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Bank Papan first-half net down.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in billion rupiah except earnings per share)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     4.57	vs     5.05</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rph)   59	  vs     65</p>
<p>    Net interest income	 23.92	vs    22.73</p>
<p>    Other operating income    18.17	vs    0.82</p>
<p>    Other operating expense   36.63	vs    19.90</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		 6.51	vs    7.20</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	   19.23	vs    18.69</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Bank Papan Sejahtera is a medium-sized privately-owned bank.</p>
